- $b_t$ as listed above for $t=1,\ldots,40$

##### Model Summary

Assign each task to exactly one CPU. The processing time of task $t$ on CPU $p$ is $b_t / f_p$. The total load on each CPU must not exceed $C_{\max}$. Minimize $C_{\max}$.[0m

